        <h2><i class="fas fa-book-open"></i> Template Guide</h2>
        <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal()">
          <i class="fas fa-times"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> What is this Template?</h3>
        <p>
          This is a <strong>n8n graphical input template</strong> that creates beautiful user interfaces
          for your workflows. Instead of API calls, your users get a clean interface to interact with your AI agents.
        </p>

