        <p>Simple 3-node workflow in n8n:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Webhook Node (GET):</strong> Receives the HTTP request</li>
          <li><strong>Code Node:</strong> Generates the HTML interface</li>
          <li><strong>Respond to Webhook Node:</strong> Returns HTML as binary file</li>
        </ul>

